{
  "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
  "juan": "Juan19",
  "section": "卷十九",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P000_S000",
      "original_quote": "《卷十九》",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P001_S000",
      "original_quote": "斗柄所指",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P002_S000",
      "original_quote": "天罡指巳天地門以月將加時，尋天罡至巳為天地初開，出軍行師任徘徊用兵大勝開地千里，指午坐帳宜彈琴指午為天地縱橫，不宜出軍，坐帳彈琴吉，指 未小通亦可裁天地小通出軍亦吉，指申迫爭君須忌天地爭史之時，用兵須忌，指酉人馬受驚骸天地閉塞之時，車傷馬死，戰主大凶，返來戌上指乖隔 出軍主士卒乖隔傷和，加亥天窄不稱懐用軍主損傷驚恐，指子半路魂魄散行至半路，魂魄不安，指醜途宿待明來為小通，出軍三十里待來朝任意而 行，必獲大勝，臨寅有喜戰獲勝行者有喜，戰必大捷，到卯閉塞宜埋葬為天地閉塞，宜藏匿避之，凡事不宜，複臨辰地關梁塞關梁閉塞，只可安營下 寨，不可妄動，掌上兵機仔細排。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P003_S000",
      "original_quote": "占迷路法",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P004_S000",
      "original_quote": "三路迷失時，天罡隨於孟仲，兩歧感應日辰，左右以規謀，路逢三叉不知何道吉，以正時占，天罡加孟左道通，加季右道通，加仲中道通，此下出軍大捷，所求必遂。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P004_S001",
      "original_quote": "若逢兩歧路，日乾吉者左道通，辰支爻吉者右道通也。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P004_S002",
      "original_quote": "如七月申時占，以巳將加地盤申上起順數，辰時天罡在地盤未上，未為季左道通，餘仿此。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P004_S003",
      "original_quote": "子午卯酉四仲，寅 申巳亥為四孟，辰戌丑未為四季。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P005_S000",
      "original_quote": "密訪",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P006_S000",
      "original_quote": "欲得賊消息，天目聽之吉天目日大吉、小吉方也。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P006_S001",
      "original_quote": "欲訪機密事，地耳不須疑地耳，太衝、從魁方也。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P007_S000",
      "original_quote": "渡河",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P008_S000",
      "original_quote": "天有三河壬子癸，地有三井卯酉辰，月將加時看三河，一河臨井必覆舟。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P008_S001",
      "original_quote": "又曰：「太衝加日辰，主風雨；",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P008_S002",
      "original_quote": "神後加季，急渡則吉」。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P009_S000",
      "original_quote": "劫糧覓水",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P010_S000",
      "original_quote": "我軍欲劫糧，大小吉下訪，我軍欲求水，小吉太衝訪。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P010_S001",
      "original_quote": "小吉、太衝為井泉之神，地下見之可得。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P011_S000",
      "original_quote": "敵使虛實",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P012_S000",
      "original_quote": "敵有使來看日辰，日上為客辰主人辰實時也，日乾上神辰剋辰上日剋時，其言虛謬不可聞，若是辰上剋日上，彼必畏我言詞真，朱空太陰日辰上乘日上主彼詐，乘辰上主我詐。",
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P013_S000",
      "original_quote": "突圍",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S000",
      "original_quote": "或被兵圍不要忙，加時出路是天罡太公曰：「兵圍千里，鬥道必通」。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S001",
      "original_quote": "鬥者，天罡也。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S002",
      "original_quote": "以月將加時尋天罡，其下一實可出。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S003",
      "original_quote": "若天罡方無路可出，當尋三官時，三官 時，亥子醜也。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S004",
      "original_quote": "，若值絳官申酉地以月將加時，若亥臨子午卯酉為絳官，宜向天盤申酉下出。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S005",
      "original_quote": "，明堂時往太衝方子臨子午卯酉為明堂，宜向天盤卯方 出。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S006",
      "original_quote": "，玉堂宜突天魁下醜臨子午卯酉為玉堂，宜向戌方出。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S007",
      "original_quote": "，利若鋒芒八極張逢豪強之賊，勢不可當，向天罡可出，此為八極張也。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S008",
      "original_quote": "，日辰上將相生吉 傷不傷視陰陽，若日辰與上將相生者吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S009",
      "original_quote": "，相剋如今有損傷日辰與上將相剋，又制日辰者，必有損傷，用兵者，宜審之。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P014_S010",
      "original_quote": "。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P015_S000",
      "original_quote": "察賊所在",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P016_S000",
      "original_quote": "聞賊未知賊所在，加時春乙夏居丁乙干寄辰，丁幹寄未。",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P016_S001",
      "original_quote": "，秋辛冬癸名天目辛乾寄戌，癸乾寄丑。",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P016_S002",
      "original_quote": "，賊當在下伏其形以月將加時，視天目之方，賊在其下。",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P016_S003",
      "original_quote": "天目者，春辰、夏未、秋戌、冬醜。",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P016_S004",
      "original_quote": "春占尋辰，餘仿此。",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P016_S005",
      "original_quote": "。",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P017_S000",
      "original_quote": "抽軍避寇",
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S000",
      "original_quote": "賊勢平凌我未強途逢兵賊，他強我弱。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S001",
      "original_quote": "，抽軍回避看天罡以月將加時，看天罡落在何宮，以避其強猛。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S002",
      "original_quote": "，系孟直須從右隱辰為天罡，如加寅申巳亥之孟神，從右道而避之。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S003",
      "original_quote": "，仲季還宜向左藏子午卯酉為四仲，辰戌丑未為四季，天罡如此向左藏之，無咎。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S004",
      "original_quote": "，從魁小吉太衝地酉為從魁，未為小吉，卯為太衝，此三神為天三門，再得除危開定，是天門地戶庇佑。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S005",
      "original_quote": "，天上加臨為好方以月將加時，看天盤卯酉未落在何宮，可以避難。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S006",
      "original_quote": "如遇旺方不可往，春不東去，餘仿此。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S007",
      "original_quote": "，大吉、神后、紫房、華蓋，能藏萬物，即行無害大吉為紫房，神後為華蓋，凡有急難，避藏之下，人不能掩藏也。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P018_S008",
      "original_quote": "。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P019_S000",
      "original_quote": "排山掌",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P020_S000",
      "original_quote": "乾六 兌七 艮八 離九",
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P021_S000",
      "original_quote": "中五",
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P022_S000",
      "original_quote": "巽四 震三 坤二 坎一",
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P023_S000",
      "original_quote": "但從震宮起甲子，紅嘴朱雀丈二長，眼似銅鈴火耀光，等閒無事傷人命，千里飛來會過江，巽宮乙丑順行裝，行到中宮莫歸火，乾宮一位莫安床，兌上占之莫修井，艮宮莫作僧道房，離宮大門君莫犯，坎宮水溝大難當，坤宮嫁娶損宅長，震宮修廚新婦亡，巽宮一位管山野，十人犯著九人殃。",
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P024_S000",
      "original_quote": "如甲子震宮數起，乙丑日至巽，忌山野。",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P024_S001",
      "original_quote": "丙寅日數至中，忌遷宅。",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P024_S002",
      "original_quote": "丁卯日數至乾，忌安床。",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P024_S003",
      "original_quote": "戊辰日數至兌，忌修井。",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P024_S004",
      "original_quote": "餘仿此類推。",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P025_S000",
      "original_quote": "鬼谷子九仙數",
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P026_S000",
      "original_quote": "河圖甲己子午九，乙庚丑未八當頭，丙辛寅申七數真，丁壬卯酉六相親，戊癸辰戌五為坎，巳亥原來數當四，其法日則干支並用，時則止用支不用干。",
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P026_S001",
      "original_quote": "如甲子日未時，干支相配合得二十六數，乃是大吉仙，餘仿此數，甲九數子亦九數，未得八數。",
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P027_S000",
      "original_quote": "吉遷凶神合數",
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S000",
      "original_quote": "十三數日光仙，吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S001",
      "original_quote": "十四數日天仙，吉《協紀》為大禍神，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S002",
      "original_quote": "；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S003",
      "original_quote": "十五數月光仙，吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S004",
      "original_quote": "十六數金玉仙，吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S005",
      "original_quote": "十七數滅門仙，凶；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S006",
      "original_quote": "十八數天德仙，吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S007",
      "original_quote": "十九數天凶神，凶；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S008",
      "original_quote": "二十數地凶神，凶；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S009",
      "original_quote": "二十一數祭國仙，凶；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S010",
      "original_quote": "二十二數地藏仙，吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S011",
      "original_quote": "二十三數喪門神，凶；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S012",
      "original_quote": "二十四數逆神仙，吉《協紀》為送福神，吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S013",
      "original_quote": "；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S014",
      "original_quote": "二十五數大善 仙，吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S015",
      "original_quote": "二十六數大吉仙，吉；",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P028_S016",
      "original_quote": "二十七數吊客神，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P029_S000",
      "original_quote": "右吉神宜上官、出行、移居、起屋、修營，所作百事大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P030_S000",
      "original_quote": "月支 寅 卯 辰 巳 午 未 申 酉 戌 亥 子 丑",
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P031_S000",
      "original_quote": "天德合 壬 巳 丁 丙 寅 己 戊 亥 辛 庚 申 乙",
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P032_S000",
      "original_quote": "月德合 辛 己 丁 乙 辛 己 丁 乙 辛 己 丁 乙",
      "paragraph_index": 32,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P033_S000",
      "original_quote": "天成日 未 酉 亥 丑 卯 巳 未 酉 亥 丑 卯 巳",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P034_S000",
      "original_quote": "天喜日 戌 亥 子 丑 寅 卯 辰 巳 午 未 申 酉",
      "paragraph_index": 34,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P035_S000",
      "original_quote": "天富日 辰 巳 午 未 申 酉 戌 亥 子 丑 寅 卯",
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P036_S000",
      "original_quote": "紅沙日 巳 酉 丑 巳 酉 丑 巳 酉 丑 巳 酉 丑",
      "paragraph_index": 36,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P037_S000",
      "original_quote": "黃沙日 午 寅 子 午 寅 子 午 寅 子 午 寅 子",
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P038_S000",
      "original_quote": "往亡日 寅 巳 申 亥 卯 午 酉 子 辰 未 戌 丑",
      "paragraph_index": 38,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P039_S000",
      "original_quote": "往亡，忌出軍、出行、上官赴任、嫁娶、進人口、求醫療病。",
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P040_T001",
      "original_quote": "重喪日　甲　乙　戊　丙　丁　己　庚　辛　戊　壬　癸　己",
      "tag": [
        "table_type"
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 40,
      "table_data": {
        "original_block": "重喪日　甲　乙　戊　丙　丁　己　庚　辛　戊　壬　癸　己"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P041_S000",
      "original_quote": "天翻地覆時　亥 戌 酉 申 未 午 酉 辰 酉 辰 未 卯",
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P042_T001",
      "original_quote": "天赦日　春戊寅　夏甲午　秋戊申　冬甲子",
      "tag": [
        "table_type"
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 42,
      "table_data": {
        "original_block": "天赦日　春戊寅　夏甲午　秋戊申　冬甲子"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P043_T001",
      "original_quote": "天貴日　春甲乙　夏丙丁　秋庚辛　冬壬癸",
      "tag": [
        "table_type"
      ],
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "table_data": {
        "original_block": "天貴日　春甲乙　夏丙丁　秋庚辛　冬壬癸"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P044_S000",
      "original_quote": "四順日　建宜行、成宜離、寅宜往、卯宜歸。",
      "paragraph_index": 44,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P045_S000",
      "original_quote": "四逆日　申不行、酉不離、七不往、八不歸。",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P046_S000",
      "original_quote": "十惡大敗日",
      "paragraph_index": 46,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P047_S000",
      "original_quote": "甲己年　三月戊戌日、七月癸亥日、十月丙申日、十一月丁亥日。",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P048_S000",
      "original_quote": "乙庚年　四月壬申日、九月乙巳日。",
      "paragraph_index": 48,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P049_S000",
      "original_quote": "丙辛年　三月辛巳日、九月庚辰日、十月甲辰日。",
      "paragraph_index": 49,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P050_S000",
      "original_quote": "戊癸年　六月己丑日。",
      "paragraph_index": 50,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P051_S000",
      "original_quote": "丁壬年　無忌。",
      "paragraph_index": 51,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P052_S000",
      "original_quote": "上元四孟月初一從堂房逐日逆數。",
      "paragraph_index": 52,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P053_S000",
      "original_quote": "順陽○ 金堂○",
      "paragraph_index": 53,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P054_S000",
      "original_quote": "賊盜● 金庫●",
      "paragraph_index": 54,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P055_S000",
      "original_quote": "寶倉○ 堂房○→",
      "paragraph_index": 55,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P056_S000",
      "original_quote": "堂房吉、金庫凶、金堂吉、順陽吉、賊盜凶、寶倉吉、天盜凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 56,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P057_S000",
      "original_quote": "中元四仲月初一從天盜逐日順數。",
      "paragraph_index": 57,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P058_S000",
      "original_quote": "天堂○ 天財○",
      "paragraph_index": 58,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P059_S000",
      "original_quote": "天門○ 天賊●",
      "paragraph_index": 59,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P060_S000",
      "original_quote": "天盜●→ 天陽○",
      "paragraph_index": 60,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P061_S000",
      "original_quote": "天倉○ 天侯●",
      "paragraph_index": 61,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P062_S000",
      "original_quote": "天盜凶、天門吉、天堂吉、天財吉、天賊凶、天陽吉、天侯凶、天倉吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 62,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P063_S000",
      "original_quote": "下元四季月初一起朱雀逐日順數。",
      "paragraph_index": 63,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P064_S000",
      "original_quote": "青龍頭○ 青龍肋○",
      "paragraph_index": 64,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P065_S000",
      "original_quote": "元武 ● 青龍足●",
      "paragraph_index": 65,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P066_S000",
      "original_quote": "白虎足● 朱雀 ●←",
      "paragraph_index": 66,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P067_S000",
      "original_quote": "白虎肋○ 白虎頭●",
      "paragraph_index": 67,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P068_S000",
      "original_quote": "朱雀凶、白虎肋吉、白虎頭凶、元武凶、青龍頭吉、青龍肋吉、青龍足凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 68,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P069_S000",
      "original_quote": "上元將軍所管四孟月出行吉凶，正、四、七、十月",
      "paragraph_index": 69,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P070_S000",
      "original_quote": "堂房日，出行神道不在，宅中求財稱意，好人相逢大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 70,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P071_S000",
      "original_quote": "金庫日，出行車馬不成，大吉失路路逢，盜賊求財不得，大凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 71,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P072_S000",
      "original_quote": "金堂日，出行吉利通，詞訟有理，求財稱意，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 72,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P073_S000",
      "original_quote": "順陽日，出行去處通達，爭訟有理，不逢盜賊，求財遂意，好人相逢，出遇酒食，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 73,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P074_S000",
      "original_quote": "賊盜日，出行不利，所求不遂，必主人亡，枷鎖臨身，不宜用。",
      "paragraph_index": 74,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P075_S000",
      "original_quote": "寶倉日，出行大人見喜，百事通達，求財遂意，衣錦還鄉，用之大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 75,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P076_S000",
      "original_quote": "中元將軍所管四仲月出行吉凶，二、五、八、十一月",
      "paragraph_index": 76,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P077_S000",
      "original_quote": "天盜日，出行求財不成，口舌臨身大凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 77,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P078_S000",
      "original_quote": "天門日，出行所求皆遂，萬事如意，貴人接引，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 78,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P079_S000",
      "original_quote": "天堂日，出行求財得財，好人相逢，凡事俱吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 79,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P080_S000",
      "original_quote": "天財日原文缺",
      "paragraph_index": 80,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P081_S000",
      "original_quote": "天賊日，求財失落，見官無理，諸事不成，大凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 81,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P082_S000",
      "original_quote": "天陽日，所求得財，婚姻和合，萬事稱心，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 82,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P083_S000",
      "original_quote": "天侯日，吉少凶多，有口舌血光之災，不可用。",
      "paragraph_index": 83,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P084_S000",
      "original_quote": "天倉日，所求得財，出官見喜，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 84,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P085_S000",
      "original_quote": "下元將軍所管四季月出行吉凶，三、六、九、十二月",
      "paragraph_index": 85,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P086_S000",
      "original_quote": "朱雀日，出行多主失財，見官無理，大凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 86,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P087_S000",
      "original_quote": "白虎頭日，出行求財遂意，去處大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 87,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P088_S000",
      "original_quote": "白虎肋日，出行求財遂心，無往不利，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 88,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P089_S000",
      "original_quote": "白虎足日，出行求財不利，不宜遠行，作事不成，不宜用。",
      "paragraph_index": 89,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P090_S000",
      "original_quote": "元武日，出行主口舌，凡事不遂，不可用。",
      "paragraph_index": 90,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P091_S000",
      "original_quote": "青龍頭日，出行利於求財，卯時出行吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 91,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P092_S000",
      "original_quote": "青龍肋日，求財遂心，凡事稱意，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 92,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P093_S000",
      "original_quote": "青龍足日，求財不遂，見官失理，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 93,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P094_S000",
      "original_quote": "伏斷日忌出軍、出行、上官、嫁娶、修船、豎柱、上粱。",
      "paragraph_index": 94,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P094_S001",
      "original_quote": "子虛、丑斗、寅室、卯女、辰箕、巳房、午角、未張、申鬼、酉觜、戌胃、亥壁。",
      "paragraph_index": 94,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P095_S000",
      "original_quote": "逐月出行吉方",
      "paragraph_index": 95,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S000",
      "original_quote": "正 月大從寅，月小從申；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S001",
      "original_quote": "二月大從子，月小從卯；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S002",
      "original_quote": "三月大從酉，月小從辰；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S003",
      "original_quote": "四月大從巳，月小從亥；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S004",
      "original_quote": "五月大從午，月小從子；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S005",
      "original_quote": "六月大從未，月小從醜；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S006",
      "original_quote": "七月大從寅，月 小從申；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S007",
      "original_quote": "八月大從午，月小從卯；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S008",
      "original_quote": "九月大從卯，月小從辰；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S009",
      "original_quote": "十月大從子，月小從巳；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S010",
      "original_quote": "十一月大從午，月小從申；",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P096_S011",
      "original_quote": "十二月大從未，月小從戌。",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan19_P097_S000",
      "original_quote": "以上當三十人，大忌月忌日，又怕天地人三殺日，壬戌、庚辰、辛巳日，庚辛壬為七煞，癸卯為截路空亡，出行大凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 97,
      "tag": []
    }
  ],
  "_source": {
    "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
    "juan": "Juan19",
